026-07-31 revenue was $2 billion, up 29.9% from $1.6 billion in the three months ended 2025-07-25.","cites":["NTAP.d.revenue.2026-04-25.2026-07-31","NTAP.d.revenue.2025-04-26.2025-07-25"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $7.4 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $1.8 billion and net income to $1.4 billion.","cites":["NTAP.d.revenue.2025-07-26.2025-10-24","NTAP.d.revenue.2025-10-25.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.revenue.2025-04-26.2026-04-24","NTAP.d.revenue.2025-04-26.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.revenue.2026-04-25.2026-07-31","NTAP.d.opinc.2025-07-26.2025-10-24","NTAP.d.opinc.2025-10-25.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.opinc.2025-04-26.2026-04-24","NTAP.d.opinc.2025-04-26.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.opinc.2026-04-25.2026-07-31","NTAP.d.netinc.2025-07-26.2025-10-24","NTAP.d.netinc.2025-10-25.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.netinc.2025-04-26.2026-04-24","NTAP.d.netinc.2025-04-26.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.netinc.2026-04-25.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.6 billion: operating cash flow of $1.9 billion less capital spending of $247 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["NTAP.d.ocf.2025-04-26.2025-10-24","NTAP.d.ocf.2025-04-26.2025-07-25","NTAP.d.ocf.2025-04-26.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.ocf.2025-04-26.2026-04-24","NTAP.d.ocf.2026-04-25.2026-07-31","NTAP.d.capex.2025-04-26.2025-10-24","NTAP.d.capex.2025-04-26.2025-07-25","NTAP.d.capex.2025-04-26.2026-01-23","NTAP.d.capex.2025-04-26.2026-04-24","NTAP.d.capex.2026-04-25.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $2.3 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent).","cites":["NTAP.deferred.2026"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 11,700 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $592,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["NTAP.q.employees","NTAP.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $21 million, after $83 million in FY2025.","cites":["NTAP.restructuring.2026","NTAP.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $2.1 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $1.5 billion in short-term investments, and $2.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent + CommercialPaper). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $1.1 billion (computed from five filed figures).","cites":["NTAP.cash.2026","NTAP.sti.2026","NTAP.debtLong.2026","NTAP.debtCurrent.2026","NTAP.debtShort.2026"]}]},"fin":{"NTAP":{}},"quotes":{"NTAP.q.employees":{"c":"NTAP","kind":"employees","n":11700,"quote":"As of April 24, 2026, we had approximately 11,700 employees worldwide.","source":"NTAP-0001193125-26-259683","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-06-05","proof":"507583842c1f60da7c98b920f30ad32a91272d271cd992e0e805f3f855c98e78"}}}